 eading\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nStudents become electrical engineers as th
 ey explore how electricity powers everyday devices. Using Snap Circuits® 
 kits\, learners build and test circuits that light bulbs\, power motors\, 
 and produce sound. Students investigate how components such as switches\, 
 resistors\, and batteries work together within a system. Through hands-on 
 experimentation\, participants make observations\, troubleshoot challenges
 \, and refine their designs. This program introduces key concepts of elect
 ric current and circuit design while encouraging critical thinking and eng
 ineering practices.
