DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Teens\n\nTeen Advisory Board presents: This pr
 ogram is for teens 13-19 years of age. Unwind\, craft\, and create at Teen
  Free Create! Bring your current creative project and enjoy a relaxed spac
 e to work alongside your friends. Whether you're into painting\, crochetin
 g\, sketching\, or collaging\, all skill levels and crafts are welcome. Su
 pplies for basic crafts and inspiration will be available\, but feel free 
 to bring your work-in-progress. Come hang out and share ideas with fellow 
 makers!Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 24th for Manhe
 im Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, June 26th for resi
 dents of other municipalities.Cancellations- Please check your email prior
  to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled. Library P
 rogram Policies:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration
  for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regis
 tering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please canc
 el your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program t
 o allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in regist
 ration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to t
 he start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The 
 program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your sp
 ot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. 
 If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, r
 egistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past t
 he start time. Drop Off Program – This program is intended for childre
 n over the age of 13 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) mus
 t be present to check in child with youth services staff prior to program.
  Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  Designated Ages – P
 lease adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registration. Only
  children in that age range will be admitted.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
