BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/choosing-native-plants-your-garden-penn-state-extension-master-gardeners-178914"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Choosing Native Plants for Your Garden with Penn State Extension M
 aster Gardeners
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260708T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260708T180000
UID:b96b4b130b6a001695966f943b4b761d@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nJoin us for this special pr
 esentation by Penn State Extension Master Gardeners! You may already know 
 about the ecological benefits that native plants bring to our landscapes\,
  but selecting and finding native plants for your own garden can be challe
 nging. How do you know which plants are actually native to your area? Wher
 e can you find these plants? And how can you make sense of plant names so 
 that you know that you’re getting what you really want? This program wil
 l help you understand what you need to know to add some new favorites to y
 our garden. For Adults and Seniors. Registration Required.Adam Barkafski  
 Adam Barkafski is a Penn State Extension Master Gardener in Lancaster Coun
 ty since 2018. A home gardener by hobby\, Adam's gardening interests began
  with perennials and later focused on native plants. He now gardens with i
 ntention to create and preserve pollinator and wildlife habitat and prefer
 s to let nature take the lead. Observing and learning from plants\, pollin
 ators\, and wildlife bring Adam some of his greatest gardening joys.Penn S
 tate Extension Master GardenersPenn State Extension Master Gardeners are v
 olunteers who have an interest and enthusiasm for gardening and are traine
 d in a broad range of horticultural topics. In return\, Master Gardeners u
 se unbiased\, research-based information to educate our communities on bes
 t practices in sustainable horticulture and environmental stewardship.
LOCATION:Adamstown\, ADM Community Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/choosing-native-plants-y
 our-garden-penn-state-extension-master-gardeners-178914
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
