 of magic and make-believe at Fairytale Feasts! In this special cooking pro
 gram young chefs will explore the foods inspired by classic fairy tales wh
 ile creating their own delicious treats. After hearing a short story to sp
 ark our imagination\, participants will prepare a few simple fairy tale–
 themed snacks—perhaps a princess-worthy treat\, a woodland snack like Li
 ttle Red Riding Hood might carry or a magical apple-inspired creation. Alo
 ng the way kids will practice basic kitchen skills like measuring\, mixing
  and assembling. We will end with a fairytale tea party and enjoy the best
  part – eating our creations! With an added sprinkle of fairy tale magic
 \, this tasty adventure is sure to be happily ever after! Ages 5-9.
