DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Health & Wellness\, Teens\, Adults\, 
 Seniors\n\nCalling All Citizen Scientists: The 25-Species Countdown! ⏱
 ️🦜The clock is ticking! We're back on the trail out back\, and we nee
 d your eyes on the skies. Whether you can tell a hawk from a handsaw or do
 n't know a robin from a blue jay\, we need your help tracking our local wi
 ldlife.Your Mission: Identify 25 unique bird species by September 1st. Hit
  the target\, and you'll earn the ultimate badge of honor: our official Bi
 rd Club Master Button.Perfect for tweens looking for a summer challenge\, 
 seniors who love the trail\, and adults who want to unplug. Let’s see wh
 o can check off their list first!
