DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSmall books. Big conversations
 . 2nd Saturdays from 2:30-3:30. Most book clubs are a marathon-- this is a
  sprint! We exclusively read books under 300 pages: perfect for the busy r
 eader who wants all the discussion without the 500-page commitment. Join u
 s for sharp conversation that's short\, sweet\, and gets straight to the p
 oint!June 13: The Heart in Winter by Kevin Barry July 11: Convenience Stor
 e Woman by Sayaka Murata August 8: The Employees by Olga Ravn September 12
 : The Most by Jessica Anthony October 10: Comfort Me with Apples by Cather
 ynne M. Valente November 14: Thornhedge by T. Kingfisher December 12: Clea
 r by Carys Davies
