X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/jeff-boyer-big-bubble-164616"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:CANCELLED Bunch of Bubbles Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260713T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260713T141500
UID:505ada9f3d35daf3d07d38ff5b760e2c@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Adult
 s\n\nBuried Stories and Big Discoveries with Bunch of Bubbles.Join us for 
 a one-of-a-kind prehistoric adventure full of stories\, science\, and gian
 t bubbles! This interactive indoor bubble show combines dazzling bubble tr
 icks\, hands-on audience participation\, storytelling\, and fun archaeolog
 y-themed discoveries. Kids will explore how bubbles connect to imagination
 \, curiosity\, and creativity—then celebrate with a short dinosaur dance
  party at the end. Perfect for families and young explorers who love dinos
 aurs\, science\, and a little bit of bubbly magic!Registration for Bunch o
 f Bubbles Bubble Show will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July1st for Manhe
 im Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 8th for re
 sidents of other municipalities.Library Program Policies Registration Requ
 irements – To help us manage our space\, please register every person wh
 o will be attending\, including adults or siblings. *For the safety and su
 pervision of all participants: Children under 8 years old must be accompan
 ied by an adult throughout the program. Children ages 8 and older are welc
 ome to attend the program independently.  No Show – Patrons failing to
  cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month wil
 l be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one m
 onth’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to 
 the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notified
  of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive
  10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and
  other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated ti
 me. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list w
 ho will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed int
 o the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter th
 e program 5 minutes past the start time. Cancellations- Please check your 
 email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled
 . Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy
  prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (including childre
 n) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a par
 ent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/jeff-boyer-big-bubble-16
 4616
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
