DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\n\n*Please register each chil
 d. Our Bubble Program is a joyful\, hands-on experience that brings learni
 ng and movement together through the magic of bubbles. Students get to exp
 eriment with a variety of bubble wands while they run\, chase\, pop\, and 
 play! • Encourages movement and whole-body play • Builds hand-eye coor
 dination in a natural\, playful way • Helps students explore cause and e
 ffect through hands-on experimentation • Offers rich sensory experiences
  that support focus and engagement • Fosters cooperation\, turn-taking\,
  and positive social interaction • Welcomes students of all abilities\, 
 with flexible ways to participate
