DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Health & Wellness\, Storytime\, Summe
 r Reading\, Babies\, Toddlers\n\nJoin the Fun! 🦋 We are excited to cele
 brate our favorite pollinators! Children will have the chance to pose for 
 a beautiful photo opportunity with monarch wings\, and we’ll be sharing 
 special songs\, poems\, and fingerplays together.  A naturalist will be pr
 esent and lead this special story time\, "Home is Calling: The Journey of 
 the Monarch Butterfly" by Catherine Pryor.Families will also take-home see
 d packets of native marsh milkweed and helpful information on how we can a
 ll work together to protect monarchs and other local butterflies and moths
 !Why are they called pollinators? Come find out at this buzz of a good tim
 e!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Break-out Room
