  rhythms are part of everyday living! Please Join Tammi and Jami as we lea
 d you through the how-to of drumming\, and the how-to of fun! Drums and fu
 n props provided\, you just bring your smiles\, hands\, and hearts.Limit 5
 0 participants.Registration required. Each person in your group MUST be re
