UID:41ca844c043cb807fb2b7b08673d3a5f@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Music\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nImagine 
 a fun-filled short trip to West Africa to play drums\, dance\, sing\, lear
 n\, and SMILE\, all at your favorite library! This program with Tammi will
  have you dancin’ on your feet and movin’ in your seat. Let’s go bac
 k in time and learn about the original story of the Lion King…but this t
 ime\, you are in it\, playing rhythms with your hands and stomping with yo
 ur feet. Drums are provided but bring your favorite percussion instrument 
 if you have one!This program is for children (over 5)\, tweens\, and teens
 .Registration for Tammy Hessen will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 1st
  for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 
 8th for residents of other municipalities.*For the safety and supervision 
 of all participants: Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an 
 adult throughout the program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to att
 end the program independently.  Library Program Policies Registration Requ
 irements –  To help us manage our space\, please register every person w
 ho will be attending\, including adults or siblings. No Show – Patrons
  failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in 
 a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a peri
 od of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hour
 s prior to the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to 
 be notified of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Pl
 ease arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for 
 parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the de
 signated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the 
 wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be 
 allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted 
 to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time. Cancellations- Please 
 check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not bee
 n cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Con
 duct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (includ
 ing children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the conse
 nt of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center BC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/tammi-hessen-161241
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
