BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/knex-rail-lab-railroad-museum-pa-166988"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:K'NEX Rail Lab with the Railroad Museum of PA
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260716T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260716T143000
UID:798b65197ca68b0841187edf362d1cdd@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\n\nDo you have what it takes to buil
 d a bridge strong enough for a train? Join the Railroad Museum of Pennsylv
 ania for a hands-on engineering adventure using K’NEX building kits!Work
 ing in teams\, young engineers will explore the real-world science behind 
 railroad bridges—how they’re designed\, what makes them strong\, and w
 hy trains need such sturdy support. Then it’s time to put your skills to
  the test by building your own bridge and seeing how much weight it can ho
 ld!This fun and interactive program is perfect for curious minds who love 
 building\, problem-solving\, and working together.For ages 8–12. All mat
 erials provided.Registration for K'NEX Rail Lab with the Railroad Museum o
 f PA will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 1st for Manheim Township and 
 East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 8th for residents of other
  municipalities.Library Program Policies:No Show – Patrons failing to ca
 ncel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will b
 e restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one mont
 h’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the
  start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notifie
 d of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 1
 0 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other
  circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At
  this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who wil
 l be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the 
 program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 
 5 minutes past the start time.Drop Off Program – This program is intende
 d for children over the age of 8 years who can participate independently. 
 Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff prior
  to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space. Designated Age
 s – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registratio
 n. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellations- Please 
 check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not bee
 n cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Con
 duct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (includ
 ing children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the conse
 nt of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/knex-rail-lab-railroad-m
 useum-pa-166988
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
