DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, STEM\, Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, 
 Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\, Everyone\n\nPennsylvania is
  full of beautiful mountains\, valleys\, and rivers filled with beautiful 
 creatures. This program will serve as an introduction to wildlife native t
 o Pennsylvania and the Mid-Atlantic region\, featuring animal ambassadors 
 from a variety of species and habitats.  Recommended for ages 5+No registr
 ation Required.    Raven Ridge Wildlife Center is a nonprofit wildlife r
 ehabilitation center that specializes in the care of injured\, orphaned\, 
 and displaced birds of prey\, mammals\, waterfowl\, and adult songbirds. O
 ur goal is to provide these animals with the care they need to get a secon
 d chance at life and return them to the wild.
