UID:8781039972a9d0e03471e0a2e2424cb9@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Adults\, Senio
 rs\n\nRyan “The BugMan” will show the audience 100’s of incredible b
 ugs and insects from around the world. Meanwhile\, he’ll be relating som
 e of the crazy-cool adventures that he took while searching for many of th
 ose same creatures. Be it land\, air or sea… “The BugMan” has experi
 enced a lifetime of travel and unusual experiences that will educate and e
 ntertain everyone. Insects are the most important part of the ecosystem an
 d critical to the survival of nearly everything on the Planet!Appropriate 
 for all agesRegistration for Ryan the Bug Man: Let's Take an Insect Advent
 ure will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 1st for Manheim Township and E
 ast Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 8th for residents of other 
 municipalities.Registration Requirements –  To help us manage our space\
 , please register every person who will be attending\, including adults or
  siblings.*For the safety and supervision of all participants: Children un
 der 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout the program. Ch
 ildren ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program independently.  
 Library Policies:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration 
 for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regist
 ering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cance
 l your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to
  allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in reg
 istration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the s
 tart of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The prog
 ram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot w
 ill be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If s
 pots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regis
 trants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start
  time.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify 
 that the program has not been cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Townshi
 p Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video r
 ecording individuals (including children) without their consent (or in the
  case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/ryan-bug-man-lets-take-i
 nsect-adventure-161337
