LAST-MODIFIED:20260617T173100Z
UID:10014741-1784314800-1784321100@figlancaster.com
SUMMARY:LIPF Presents: American String Quartet & Ruiqi Fang
DESCRIPTION:One of the world’s finest quartets takes the stage alongside prize-winning pianist to open the 2026 Lancaster International Piano Festival with a thrilling program of Haydn\, Debussy and Dohnányi! Internationally recognized as one of the world’s finest quartets\, the American String Quartet has spent decades honing the luxurious sound for which it is famous. The Quartet celebrated its 45th anniversary in 2019\, and\, in its years of touring\, has performed in all fifty states and has appeared in the most important concert halls worldwide. “Decidedly personal” “Intelligent playing” and “Versatile” are just a few examples of how critics have glowingly described pianist Ruiqi Fang’s solo recital at the Basílica Menor del Convento de San Francisco de Asís in Havana\, Cuba. Ruiqi Fang holds the coveted Doctor of Musical Arts degree\, Master of Music degree and Professional Studies Diploma from Manhattan School of Music\, under the tutelage of the world-renowned pedagogue Dr. Solomon. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lipf-presents-american-string-quartet-ruiqi-fang/
LOCATION:Barshinger Center at F&M College\, College Avenue\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/American-String-Quartet-Ruiqi-Fang.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster International Piano Festival":MAILTO:lancasterpianofestival@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/eaglemania-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T200000
DTSTAMP:20260705T000615
CREATED:20260126T143006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T173804Z
UID:10001851-1784318400-1784318400@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Eaglemania
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $29 $39 $49 \nRelive the legendary sound of the Eagles with EagleMania\, the world’s premier Eagles tribute band. Celebrating the iconic music that defined a generation\, EagleMania delivers a masterfully authentic concert experience — from soaring harmonies and precision musicianship to the unmistakable spirit of classic American rock. \nHear all the timeless hits you know and love\, including “Hotel California\,” “Take It Easy\,” “Desperado\,” “Life in the Fast Lane\,” and many more. Every performance is a faithful recreation of the Eagles’ signature sound\, capturing the intricate guitar work\, lush vocal blends\, and laid-back California vibe that made the band legendary. \nWhether you’re a lifelong fan or discovering the music for the first time\, EagleMania offers an unforgettable night of nostalgia\, energy\, and world-class live performance. Sit back\, sing along\, and experience the soundtrack of a generation — live on stage. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/eaglemania-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/EM_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
