X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/storytime-andy-armadillo-texas-roadhouse-mascot-175103"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Storytime with Andy Armadillo - Texas Roadhouse Mascot
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T113000
UID:eb4992e1ba5e3b375815cc6312d39ad2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Summer Reading\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tw
 eens\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nHowdy Partners! 🤠 Get ready for a ro
 otin' tootin' good time with Andy Armadillo - the Texas Roadhouse mascot! 
  He'll be coming to our library for a very special story time.  This progr
 am will be fun for the whole family.  There will be stories\, crafts\, son
 gs\, and best of all\, Andy Armadillo!  Registration for this event is req
 uired.  Fun for all ages! Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 July 1st for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday
 \, July 8th for residents of other municipalities.Library Program Policies
  Registration Requirements – To help us manage our space\, please regist
 er every person who will be attending\, including adults or siblings. No S
 how – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 lib
 rary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future pr
 ograms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registration
 s at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow those on the
  waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status. Late 
 Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the prog
