UID:f3d00e5bff7616a08623c3aa52c4c3ca@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Music\, Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Adults
 \, Seniors\n\nMark DeRose Music & Art’s show combines Mark’s love for 
 the visual arts with his love for songwriting. Mark’s songs\, artwork\, 
 videos and the show’s activities all complement one another in an effort
  to communicate his message that encourages his young listeners to embrace
  and enjoy life to its fullest\, be creative individuals\, and most import
 antly\, confidently be themselves.Appropriate for all ages*For the safety 
 and supervision of all participants: Children under 8 years old must be ac
 companied by an adult throughout the program. Children ages 8 and older ar
 e welcome to attend the program independently.  Registration for Mark DeRo
 se Music & Art will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 8th for Manheim Tow
 nship and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 15th for residen
 ts of other municipalities.Registration Requirements – To help us manage
  our space\, please register every person who will be attending\, includin
 g adults or siblings.Library Program Policies:No Show – Patrons failing 
 to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month w
 ill be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one
  month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior t
 o the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be no
 tified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arr
 ive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and 
 other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated tim
 e. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list wh
 o will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into
  the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the pro
 gram 5 minutes past the start time.Cancellations- Please check your email 
 prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled. Phot
 ography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohi
 bits photographing or video recording individuals (including children) wit
 hout their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or
  guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mark-derose-music-art-ce
 lebration-creativity-161261
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
