DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Teens\n\nTeen Advisory Board presents: This pr
 ogram is for teens 13-19 years of age. Unwind\, craft\, and create at Teen
  Free Create! Bring your current creative project and enjoy a relaxed spac
 e to work alongside your friends. Whether you're into painting\, crochetin
 g\, sketching\, or collaging\, all skill levels and crafts are welcome. Su
 pplies for basic crafts and inspiration will be available\, but feel free 
 to bring your work-in-progress. Come hang out and share ideas with fellow 
 makers!Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 8th for Manhei
 m Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, July 10th for resid
 ents of other municipalities.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their
  registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restrict
 ed from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time
 . Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of 
