 l logic. If you thought last time was wild\, wait until we debate the abso
 lute audacity of a vampire and a werewolf having a whispered argument abou
 t boundaries while sharing a tent. 🧛‍♂️🐺Relive the peak Team E
 dward vs. Team Jacob mania before the weddings and wings take over. No eng
 agement ring- or boundary line- left unexamined.Join our 18+ book club as 
