BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/kids-garden-club-177643"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Kids' Garden Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T174500
UID:4b3d3aa1108ceba81540770a2fe45296@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nSummer is here - our planters need our
  attention!  Join us on our patio for our exciting garden time!  (Rain or 
 shine - if it's raining\, we'll be meeting indoors and limit our outside t
 ime.)  We'll get our hands dirty in the planters\, do some crafts\, and ma
 ybe even read a story!  We'll supply the seeds\, the tools\, gloves\, and 
 the planters.  Plan on getting a little dirty.  This program is for childr
 en ages 6 - 9 years old.  Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age r
 estrictions designated on your registration. Only children in that age ran
 ge will be admitted.   Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\,
  July 8th or Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday
 \, July 15th for residents of other municipalities.Drop Off Program – 
 This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years who can part
 icipate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with you
 th services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the even
 t space.  *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; howe
 ver\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the prog
 ram room for the duration of the program. Cancellations- Please check yo
 ur email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancel
 led. Library Program Policies No Show – Patrons failing to cancel thei
 r registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restric
 ted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s tim
 e. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of
  the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their ch
 ange in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes
  prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circ
 umstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this
  time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be 
 granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the progr
 am. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5
  minutes past the start time. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Li
 brary Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording in
 dividuals (including children) without their consent (or in the case of a 
 child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Patio
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/kids-garden-club-177643
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
