BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/pennsylvania-paleontology-lancaster-county-parks-170767"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Pennsylvania Paleontology by Lancaster County Parks
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T190000
UID:fd0ecbb7ef39bce65e0fdc596f7dde27@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nDid you know tha
 t Pennsylvania was once covered with a shallow body of ancient waters? Thi
 s sea of water was teeming with life and evidence of that can still be fou
 nd today! Learn\, hands-on\, just what PA looked like 400+ million years a
 go\, see real fossils that have been found here\, and learn about our stat
 e fossil\, the trilobite. Participants will then work together to put toge
 ther a big (paper) dinosaur! 🦖Registration for Pennsylvania Paleontolog
 y by Lancaster County Parks will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 8th fo
 r Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 15t
 h for residents of other municipalities.Registration Requirements – To h
 elp us manage our space\, please register every person who will be attendi
 ng\, including adults or siblings. Accompanying Adults – This program 
 is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be
  engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted. Cancellations- 
 Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has 
 not been cancelled. Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing 
 to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month w
 ill be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one
  month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior t
 o the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notifi
 ed of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arri
 ve 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking a
 nd other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated 
 time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list
  who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed i
 nto the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter 
 the program 5 minutes past the start time. Photography - The Manheim Towns
 hip Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video
  recording individuals (including children) without their consent (or in t
 he case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/pennsylvania-paleontolog
 y-lancaster-county-parks-170767
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
