SUMMARY:Teen SummerZine
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T140000
UID:5683c77e769a3797a27eb1eb53815be6@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Teens\n\nTeens will learn from local arts pro
 fessionals while creating their own hand-made publications that can includ
 e comics\, fan art and fan fiction\, poetry\, collage\, and illustrations.
  All materials provided\, including snacks! Students may submit their favo
 rite pieces for publication into a county-wide digital zine that will be a
 vailable for checkout through Libby at the end of the summer. All Lancaste
 r County teens are welcome to participate. Registration Required. For ages
  12-19. Sessions will take place at the following times and locations: Jun
 e 13 @ 1pm @ Manheim Township Library: Create Comics with graphic novelist
  Jamar NicholasJune 27 @ 12:30pm @ Ephrata Library: Make a FanZine with La
 ncaster Zine Fest's Kim HollandJuly 11 @ 12:30pm @ Ephrata Library: Create
  Collage Poetry with author and poet Lindsay BandyJuly 25 @ 1pm @ Quarryvi
 lle Library: Make Zine Art with local artist Ciana Malchione
LOCATION:Adamstown
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-summerzine-174711
