 w – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 libra
 ry programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future prog
 rams for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations 
 at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow those on the w
 aiting list to be notified of their change in registration status. Late Ar
 rivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pro
 mptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited t
 o those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regi
 strants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not
  be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time. Photog
 raphy - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibi
 ts photographing or video recording individuals (including children) witho
 ut their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or g
 uardian).
