UID:9067e70a2a7564b5701d378e399e4514@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults
 \n\nGet ready to laugh and learn with the one and only Ridiculous Nicholas
 ! This high-energy\, hilarious science show is packed with wild experiment
 s\, amazing demonstrations\, and non-stop fun.Ridiculous Nicholas brings s
 cience to life with outrageous antics\, surprising facts\, and plenty of a
 udience participation. From crazy chemical reactions to mind-blowing physi
 cs tricks\, this show will keep kids (and grown-ups!) on the edge of their
  seats—and maybe rolling on the floor with laughter!It’s silly. It’s
  smart. It’s science like you’ve never seen it before. Perfect for fam
 ilies and children of all ages!*For the safety and supervision of all part
 icipants: Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throu
 ghout the program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the pro
 gram independently.  Registration for Ridiculous Nicholas Super Science Sh
 ow will open at9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd for Manheim Township and Ea
 st Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 29th for residents of other 
 municipalities.Registration Requirements – To help us manage our space\,
  please register every person who will be attending\, including adults or 
 siblings.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to veri
 fy that the program has not been cancelled. Library Program PoliciesNo Sho
 w – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library
  programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future progra
 ms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at
  least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the
  waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late A
 rrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to 
 allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly
  at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to tho
 se on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registran
 ts may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be perm
 itted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Photography - The
  Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photogra
 phing or video recording individuals (including children) without their co
 nsent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/ridiculous-nicholas-supe
 r-science-show-161045
