BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/kids-garden-club-177382"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Kids' Garden Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260826T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260826T174500
UID:c0b80d5c82a34c09ea63e1c0c4f1e127@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nSummer is here - our planters need our
  attention!  Join us on our patio for our exciting garden time!  (Rain or 
 shine - if it's raining\, we'll be meeting indoors and limit our outside t
 ime.)  We'll get our hands dirty in the planters\, do some crafts\, and ma
 ybe even read a story!  We'll supply the seeds\, the tools\, gloves\, and 
 the planters.  Plan on getting a little dirty.  This program is for childr
 en ages 6 - 9 years old.  Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age r
 estrictions designated on your registration. Only children in that age ran
 ge will be admitted.   Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\,
  August 12th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wedne
 sday\, August 19th for residents of other municipalities.Drop Off Program 
 – This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years who ca
 n participate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child wi
 th youth services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in th
 e event space.  *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\
 ; however\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside th
 e program room for the duration of the program. Library Program Policies
  No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 
 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for futu
 re programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registr
 ations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow those o
 n the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status. 
 Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the
  program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will be
 gin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forf
 eited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain
 \, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will
  not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time. 
 Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy p
 rohibits photographing or video recording individuals (including children)
  without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a paren
 t or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Patio
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/kids-garden-club-177382
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
