BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/celtic-thunder-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T193000
DTSTAMP:20260705T000615
CREATED:20260306T143013Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T183744Z
UID:10001852-1789241400-1789241400@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:An Evening with Celtic Thunder: Celebrate Your Favorite Songs
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $64 $74 $84 \nCeltic Thunder returns with an electrifying celebration of Irish music\, storytelling\, and powerful vocal harmony. Known around the world for their dynamic stage productions and charismatic performers\, Celtic Thunder blends traditional Irish songs with contemporary favorites\, delivering a concert experience that is both uplifting and unforgettable. \nBacked by a talented band and enhanced with dramatic lighting and theatrical staging\, the group’s acclaimed vocalists bring passion and personality to every performance. From rousing anthems and beloved ballads to lively folk tunes\, each song showcases the rich musical heritage of Ireland while adding a modern energy that has captivated audiences worldwide. \nWith multi-platinum albums\, sold-out tours\, and millions of fans across the globe\, Celtic Thunder continues to thrill audiences with their signature mix of powerful vocals\, humor\, and heartfelt performances. Join them for an evening filled with stirring music\, Irish spirit\, and pure entertainment. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/celtic-thunder-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CT_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/the-australian-pink-floyd-show-the-happiest-days-of-our-lives-greatest-hits-26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260913T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260913T190000
DTSTAMP:20260705T000615
CREATED:20260210T170023Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T183906Z
UID:10001857-1789326000-1789326000@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:The Australian Pink Floyd Show: The Happiest Days Of Our Lives - Greatest Hits 26
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $59 $69 $79 \nVIP Meet & Greet Package $192 \n\nOne premium reserved ticket\nEarly entry into the venue\nExclusive meet & greet with members of TAPFS\nGroup photograph with members of TAPFS\nLimited edition tour poster; autographed\nCustom TAPFS socks\nCommemorative ticket magnet\nSpecially designed TAPFS cinch bag\nOfficial meet & greet laminate & lanyard\nLimited availability\n\nThe Australian Pink Floyd Show is internationally recognized as the world’s premier Pink Floyd tribute\, delivering faithful\, note-for-note recreations of the band’s legendary music in a full-length live concert experience. Spanning Pink Floyd’s iconic catalogue\, the show captures the power\, precision\, and emotional depth of the original recordings and tours. \nBeyond the music\, audiences are immersed in a spectacular production featuring synchronized lighting\, lasers\, high-resolution video\, and signature visual elements inspired by Pink Floyd’s historic live performances. With decades of touring experience and a reputation for musical excellence\, The Australian Pink Floyd Show offers fans of all generations a breathtaking evening that celebrates the sound and spectacle of one of rock’s most influential bands. \n“Setting the gold standard” – The Times \n“For the record TAPFS are a phenomenon to be witnessed live… It’s almost enough to make you forget you haven’t been watching Pink Floyd\, but a surrogate band” – Prog  \n“Probably the most popular tribute band in the world” – Sunday Times ‘Culture’ \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance. \n 
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/the-australian-pink-floyd-show-the-happiest-days-of-our-lives-greatest-hits-26/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/TAPFS_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
