DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 16th for Manheim Towns
 hip and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, September 18th for residen
 ts of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are 
 limited to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations
 - Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the program ha
 s not been cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registrat
 ion for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from re
 gistering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please c
 ancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in
  registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to t
 he start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The 
 program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your sp
 ot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. 
 If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, r
 egistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the s
 tart time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/book-babies-pm-session-1
 69736
